# Arrivals Attendant

sunrise-arrivals-attendant-welcome = Hello, { $name }. You have been assigned the position of "{ $job}". We are en route to Station "{ $station}". Estimated time of arrival: { $eta } seconds. Please make yourself comfortable.
sunrise-arrivals-attendant-arrival = We have arrived at Station "{ $station }". Please disembark the shuttle. Have a productive shift!
sunrise-arrivals-attendant-evac = The shuttle will be departing shortly. Please exit the vessel.
sunrise-arrivals-forced-evac = You have been forcibly disembarked onto the station, as the shuttle is returning to the Spaceport.

sunrise-arrivals-shuttle-docking-blocked = Attention! The arrival docking bay is obstructed by an unauthorized object. Please clear the dock immediately for the incoming shuttle.
sunrise-arrivals-shuttle-cc-sender = Central Command

sunrise-arrivals-failsafe-teleport = The arrival shuttle has become stuck in transit. You have been teleported to the station. God bless Wiggers' cheat code.

sunrise-arrivals-attendant-blocked = Apologies; the docking ports at Station "{ $station }" are blocked or occupied. We will have to wait briefly in a holding pattern.
